==Dialogue==
{{Dialogue Start}}
:'''Ganxue:''' Welcome to the official Merch Shop of Pioneer Association. We adopt a point redemption system.
:{{DIcon}} I want some Souvenirs
:{{DIcon}} Gourmet Rumors
::'''Ganxue:''' The recipe for the [[Braising Sauce]]? Hehe, I happen to know it.
::'''Ganxue:''' So, what kind of precious, shiny, commemorative coin are you going to trade with me, huh?
::{{DIcon}} ...
::'''Ganxue:''' ...
::'''Ganxue:''' Ah, forget it. You seem unwilling to answer my quiz. It's not fun at all.
::'''Ganxue:''' I'll just tell you. The secret is a small amount of [[sugar]], melted over a low heat and stirred for a certain amount of time, and then added to the Braising Sauce. That's it.
::'''Ganxue:''' As for the timing and the duration, well, I'll leave that for you to figure out!
:{{DIcon}} Chat
::'''Ganxue:''' Hello there, feel free to browse around. Our team put a lot of love into designing all these goodies.
::'''Ganxue:''' Check out this badge shaped like a snow mountain. It's got this cool feel to it, made from the shell of a [[Hoartoise]]!
::'''Ganxue:''' And here's an inkwell that looks just like a [[Roseshroom]]. Give it a gentle press, and voila! It sprays out like the real deal, except it's ink!
::'''Ganxue:''' What do you think? Aren't they adorable?
:{{DIcon|Exit}} Leave
{{Dialogue End}}

